# hover_espnow.expect — assert the radio→comm→arm→control→motor path runs from
# genuine ESP-NOW controller input (no back-door). 無線→comm→arm→制御の全鎖を検証。
exit 0
log_contains any "scenario] driver online"            # the scenario driver ran
log_contains any "Connected to controller"            # comm accepted the packets
log_contains any "Motors ARMED"                       # arm rising edge handled
log_contains any "ControlArbiter: T=0.50"             # hover throttle reached the control loop
order "Armed" "ControlArbiter: T=0.50"                # arm precedes throttle-up
# Stable hover is NOT asserted here: with the INA3221 power monitor unemulated
# (E3), vbat decays and duty saturates, so the craft lifts off then climbs away.
# The command/arm/control path is correct; altitude hold is gated on E3.
# 安定ホバーはここでは検証しない（E3 INA3221 未実装で vbat 減衰→上昇継続）。
skip stable-hover gated on E3 INA3221 (vbat) — craft climbs until vbat is modelled
